@startuml
actor 用户
participant "QueryPage.vue" as QueryPage
participant "dataAPI" as DataAPI
participant "data_routes.py" as DataRoutes
participant "db_service.py" as DBService
database "MySQL" as MySQL

用户 -> QueryPage : 选择筛选条件并点击查询
QueryPage -> DataAPI : querySales(params)
DataAPI -> DataRoutes : GET /api/data/sales
DataRoutes -> DataRoutes : 校验 JWT / 参数
DataRoutes -> DBService : query_sales(start,end,region,category,channel,group_by)
DBService -> MySQL : 执行聚合 SQL
MySQL --> DBService : 返回结果集
DBService --> DataRoutes : summary + series + by_category + by_region
DataRoutes --> DataAPI : JSON 响应
DataAPI --> QueryPage : 结果数据
QueryPage -> QueryPage : 更新卡片/图表/表格
QueryPage --> 用户 : 展示查询结果
@enduml
